  m_text: "Stranded. In Space. Alone.\n\nThis is your ship. Survive until the timer is up.\nMove:   WASD\nShoot:   Click or Space Bar\nAim:      Mouse\n\nCoins give you more ammo. \nCollide to collect.\nYou'll need it.\n\nAliens and Asteroids appear on the edges and move straight. \nDon't touch, or you lose health.\nShoot them to decrease their health and destroy them.\n\nComets orbit the player, but can sometimes stray.\nDon't touch, or you lose health.\nComets can't be destroyed, only avoided."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
